    <h1>Why 95% of AI Pilots Fail &amp; What the Successful 5% Do Differently</h1>

    <p class="sub">
      AI isn’t failing because the technology is bad. It’s failing because the workflow
      around it is broken — especially in recruiting.
    </p>

    <div class="hairline"></div>

    <div class="backRow backRow--split">
      <a class="backLink" href="/articles/">← Back to Articles</a>

      <div class="ctaRow ctaRow--tight">
